epth of the valley.","The entirety of Velaka spreads out below this colossus of sand, the tremendous height of the mountain towering over all others within sight.  From here the famous star-shaped patterns of the dune field are immediately apparent, looking much like an army of immense starfish crawling toward the mountains on the horizon out of a great ocean, leagues away.  Unlike many of the other regions of the desert, no telltale signs of life persist here, proving this as the most untouched corner of this barren land."],"exits":[{"to":119,"exit":"north","move":"rt north","hidden":true},{"to":119,"exit":"northeast","move":"rt northeast"},{"to":122,"exit":"east","move":"rt east","hidden":true},{"to":121,"exit":"southeast","move":"rt southeast","hidden":true},{"to":119,"exit":"south","move":"rt south","hidden":true},{"to":121,"exit":"southwest","move":"rt southwest","hidden":true},{"to":121,"exit":"west","move":"rt west","hidden":true},{"to":121,"exit":"northwest","move":"rt northwest"}]},
